---
description: Determine whether one reconciled issue revision can be frozen.
args:{issue:IssueState;findings:IssueFinding[];coverage:{coverageGaps:string[];redundancies:string[];contingencyMatches:string[];};checkpoint:EditorialCheckpoint}
returns:IssueReadinessPacket
---
Keep the issue in review while any required story is unaccepted, reporting or fact checks remain, rights are unresolved, or coverage gaps lack an editorial disposition. A late photo-credit correction invalidates affected print, web and promotional assets and must update each derivative before freeze. When clear, bind the packet to issue revision, exact commissions and asset revisions; preserve the prior checkpoint for rollback.
